# Build output and caches. Copying these in makes the context enormous and can
# poison a build with binaries compiled against a different SDK.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.vercel/

.git/
.github/
docs/
doc-starter/
plan/
**/*.md

# Never in an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
